// BetterFlea - WEB: the settings page
// Open https://<your server address>:6969/betterflea in a browser to change the other settings from there.
// The first visit makes an admin account; changing settings needs that login, and anyone else only sees the flea's
// stats. Forgot the password? Delete data/admin.json and restart the server.
// Lines that start with // are notes. After you change a setting here, restart the server.
{
  "enabled": true                  // false = no settings page
}